OL,3,ABrass band trumpets 14th win as
OL,4,ABritain's best
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 124-year-old brass band known for
OL,7,Fbeing one of the best in the world has
OL,8,Fwon its 14th British title.
OL,10,FFoden's Band came out on top at the
OL,11,F172nd British Open Brass Band
OL,12,FChampionship, held at the Symphony Hall
OL,13,Fin Birmingham on Saturday.
OL,15,FIt was the latest accolade won by the
OL,16,Fgroup, from Sandbach, Cheshire, which
OL,17,Fhas often been at the top of the world
OL,18,Frankings since it formed in 1902.
OL,20,F"We're over the moon; the band played
OL,21,Ffantastic," said Mark Wilkinson, the
OL,22,Fmanager and principal cornet player.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
